User Role

Account management (registration, login, profile editing)
Create, edit, and delete own posts and comments
Follow topics/categories of interest
Subscribe to threads for notifications
Upvote/downvote content
Send private messages to other users
Search functionality
Report inappropriate content
Bookmark favorite threads
View their activity history

Moderator Role
All user capabilities, plus:
Review and act on reported content
Hide/delete inappropriate posts or comments
Apply temporary user restrictions/timeouts
Move threads between categories
Lock or unlock threads to prevent further comments
Pin important threads to category tops
Merge similar threads
Edit post tags/categories
View basic moderation metrics

Admin Role
All moderator capabilities, plus:
Create/edit/delete forum categories and subcategories
Manage user roles (promote users to moderators, etc.)
Ban users permanently
Configure forum settings and appearance
Access system-wide analytics and reporting
Manage moderation team
Create and modify forum rules
Implement site-wide announcements
Manage integrations with other platforms
Database/content backup functionality